message: >-
  If you use Legacy Hardware Integration Gateway (LHIG) in academic work, please cite it as below.
title: Legacy Hardware Integration Gateway (LHIG)
abstract: >-
  OpenBench is a C++17 daemon that bridges legacy laboratory and
  industrial instruments — SCPI bench instruments, serial sensors,
  Modbus PLCs, and other TCP/text-protocol devices — to modern
  observability stacks via OPC UA, MQTT, REST, and Prometheus.
  Devices are described declaratively in YAML; no per-device code is
  required.
